+  session-gate7
+  PASS: claim
+  PASS: status
+  skip: gitlab gates (GITLAB_TEST_PROJECT unset)
+  PASS: receipt gates 0-7
+
+The opening sweep also deleted jrit-loop-scratch-1789330041-508, the repo ringer's killed check run leaked (SIGKILL at 60 s cannot fire the EXIT trap), so the sweep gate did its job on real data.
+Post-fix `gh repo list jroethel --limit 200 | grep jrit-loop-scratch` prints nothing (grep rc=1).
+`bash ci/budget-check.sh` exit 0: helper SLOC 196 (budget 200), PASS: budget.
