+WHY THE CHECK STILL CANNOT FIT ITS 60 S CEILING (arithmetic, all measured)
+
+The two dominant blocks are inside receipt.sh, which the spec locks with "Change nothing else in the helper": 51 issue edits x 0.66 s + 67 auth guards x 0.29 s = 53.5 s.
+The check's own step 10 runs `gh repo list` in the check process, unpinned, costing ~10.5 s (0.54 s pinned, ~11 s unpinned, both measured).
+Structural steps plus budget-check plus export add ~2 s.
