+ringer.py line 55: CHECK_TIMEOUT_S = 60 -> 300 (or 120).
+Optional second squeeze, also outside my ownership: pin the two hostnames in checks/u04.sh step 10 the same way the test does, dropping that step from ~10.5 s to ~0.5 s.
